  "statement": "A function \\(f\\) satisfies, for all nonnegative integers \\(x\\) and \\(y\\) :\n\n- \\(f(0, x)=f(x, 0)=x\\)\n- If \\(x \\geq y \\geq 0, f(x, y)=f(x-y, y)+1\\)\n- If \\(y \\geq x \\geq 0, f(x, y)=f(x, y-x)+1\\)\n\nFind the maximum value of \\(f\\) over \\(0 \\leq x, y \\leq 100\\).",
  "answerChoices": [],
