    {
      "id": "sol.hmmt-nov-guts-2015-p18.hmmt",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "Answer: 101\nFirstly, \\(f(100,100)=101\\).\nTo see this is maximal, note that \\(f(x, y) \\leq \\max \\{x, y\\}+1\\), say by induction on \\(x+y\\).",
